\newlabel{fig:id-heat}{{1}{3}{Intrinsic dimension (TwoNN) heatmap on GPT-2. Rows index transformer blocks, columns index context length $T$. The middle blocks show a marked drop as $T$ grows, consistent with progressive collapse onto a low-dimensional attractor}{figure.caption.1}{}}
